aracterName":"夜久 月子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4788"},"originalCharacterName":"夜久 月子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukiko is the first female student to attend Seigetsu Academy and is often pursued by many of the other male students. She is part of the Student Council, the Archery Club, and is also on clinic duty. She always strives to do her best, which sometimes results in overworking herself to the point of collapsing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a total of 12 potential love interests, although this number increases in the After Season games due to the introduction of new characters and the ability to date minor characters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Starry☆Sky Wikia"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukiko is drawn without eyes in the original Starry☆Sky. After the release of After series and all game releases, player have the option to have Tsukiko's eyes included in CGs or not."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4788"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56442d5ec2d3d139ee3fa7ce0cfcb83a11c0827d0445725cce9141550cdd0b55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a6b3d37e06d6198ec9f8d50605237831f4813355a655dfdd2459b0d564eeb45f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4796","characterName":"金久保 誉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4796"},"originalCharacterName":"金久保 誉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"514"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Homare represents the Taurus. He is the captain of the archery club. He is openly friendly and often settles arguments between Ryunosuke and Azusa, but is prone to feel pressured for the success of the archery club. He is a third year. His best friends are Shiranui Kazuki and Shirogane Oushirou from the same year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4796"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1b0b9c1e8b80a7105f7ef8fd6322ada9ca7c3b5ca9fac4d3e517d28f391794e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/8275609be53b0a472253ff2b78249a77c168dc74461af7361c63be9a54139d78.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"保志 総一朗","creatorId":"vndb:s114","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s114","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s114","name":"保志 総一朗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33613","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4797","characterName":"宮地 龍之介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4797"},"originalCharacterName":"宮地 龍之介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1103"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryunosuke represents the Scorpio. He is the sub-captain of the archery club. He appears to be serious and calm, but hides a penchant for sweets. Ryunosuke has kept an eye out for Tsukiko ever since he first saw her. He is a second year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4797"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50c75dcbc0da40bd0c971e7a9a2136cd9943b8ca3ef4e06206f46da5935587d7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1ddfb05ac92cd7ac4a2fb91a401220f44e84c35090cd1db335fe9a5b9585a4e8.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神谷 浩史","creatorId":"vndb:s132","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s132","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s132","name":"神谷 浩史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33615","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4798","characterName":"木ノ瀬 梓","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4798"},"originalCharacterName":"木ノ瀬 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1220"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Azusa represents the Sagittarius. Although he is a newcomer to the archery club, he has met Tsukiko before and inspired her to become better at it. He is cocky, confident of himself and he declares himself as a natural genius. Azusa often flirts with Tsukiko and his actions annoy Ryunosuke a lot. He is a firs